According to archmage84  <archmage84@live.com>:
> Alright, fair point. I've probably overreacted here. But is 5 luck
> such a huge loss? Don't you recover it automatically?

Negative luck slowly gets back to zero, unless you have a cursed
or uncursed luckstone (or similar) in your inventory. Still, this
is a slow process and in the meantime, bad luck means tough times
(e.g. it gets harder to hit monsters, and you cannot pray).

However, luck does not grow automatically beyond zero. There are several
ways to increase your luck, but they are not automatic. There are also
good reasons why you would like a more-than-zero luck (gifts from
prayer, "blessed gain ability" from magical fountains...).

That's alignment which grows up to its current maximum, more or less
automatically (you have to kill monsters, but hey, you would do that
anyway).


